#: src/journey/preparation/preparation-details.tsx
msgctxt "BUZMgx"
msgid "Your progress is how much you've studied times how well you know it: right answers, memory and weekly challenges. Harder topics count more, and it stays under 75% until you've answered them and taken a weekly challenge."
msgstr "Tes progrès se calculent en multipliant ce que tu as étudié par ta maîtrise du contenu : tes réponses correctes, ta mémoire et les défis hebdomadaires. Les sujets plus difficiles comptent davantage, et le pourcentage reste sous 75 % tant que tu n’as pas répondu aux questions correspondantes et relevé un défi hebdomadaire."

#: src/journey/preparation/preparation-details.tsx
msgctxt "OYEt04"
msgid "Your preparation is how much you've studied times how well you know it: right answers, memory and full reviews. Harder and more frequent topics count more, and it stays under 75% until you've answered them and done a full review in your test's format."
